- **Replays.** Step 1 changes engine behaviour, so a recorded game in which a standing Unit was animated would fold differently. Classify's stage 2 found no divergence, the cargo tests include the golden replay, and every fuzz game above folds to its hash. No catalog or script changed, so R767000 does not apply: add no version gate.
